420 0 obj
<<
/A 1683 0 R
/Alt (Diagram of the design task for an autonomous offshore crane, shown as a 3D model of a single-boom laboratory crane. Callouts label the actuation topology \(EHC selected from three candidates, with images of the EHC and EMC options\), structural design, boom design, cylinder placement, and the autonomy stack. A band at the top lists the design inputs. A band at the bottom lists what no machine-consumable format holds: why each option was graded as it was, the criterion weights for this duty, and how the choice propagates into sensing, control, and the intelligent twin)
/K [18 1684 0 R]
/P 129 0 R
/Pg 48 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 3)
/Type /StructElem
>>
